<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>RRSOS PCC Live</title>
    <base href="/" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="@Assets["app.css"]" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="@Assets["RRSOS.PCC.Dashboard.styles.css"]" />
    <HeadOutlet />
</head>

<body>
    @* Prerendering would run this component's OnInitialized twice (once statically, once for the real
       circuit), each subscribing to LiveFileService/WorldFileService independently — on the first alert,
       both instances' cooldowns are empty and the voice narrator speaks it twice. This app has no
       first-paint/SEO need for prerendering, so it's simplest to just turn it off. *@
    <Routes @rendermode="new InteractiveServerRenderMode(prerender: false)" />
    <script src="@Assets["_framework/blazor.web.js"]"></script>
    <script src="js/radar.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
